            },
            "virtualMs": 1,
            "wholeRunCantCheckOk": "scheduling",
            "returnedType": "array"
          },
          "why": "process.nextTick vs a promise callback: the order depends on how the caller starts the call (inside a promise callback or directly). Honest: the order is not a plain fact about the code."
        }
